window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I don't date. Ever. And especially not single dads.</b></p> <p>I'm cursed and refuse to damage anyone else despite my yearning for a picture-perfect family. So when my brother asks me to organize his company's fall festival, I happily trade my lonely nights of binge-watching fitness videos for pumpkins and hay bales.</p> <p>Everything is going great until my brother's new employee, Dawson Reed, volunteers to assist me in planning the party. He's hotter than a bonfire and has a son as sweet as apple pie.</p> <p>The problem with being around Dawson is that he's making my forbidden dream of a white picket fence and happily ever after seem possible. But I can't. I'll just have to accept my fate as a reclusive witch with a broom and black cat.</p> <p>Except…I want that life. I want <i>them.</i> How do I chase after my dream while keeping my past from destroying everything?</p> <p>Fall with Me <i>is a sweet with a sprinkling of heat, single dad, forced proximity, and opposites attract romcom. It has all the cozy fall vibes you'd expect, such as apple picking, a fall festival, hiking, watching movies, football, and yummy food.</i></p>"; 
